#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:216
msgid ""
"Nothing is tracked until you enter an ID here. Google Analytics 4 loads only "
"when no Tag Manager container is set. Mention the tracking in your privacy "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"គ្មានការតាមដានទេ រហូតដល់អ្នកបញ្ចូល ID នៅទីនេះ។ Google Analytics 4 ផ្ទុកតែនៅពេលគ្មាន "
"Tag Manager ប៉ុណ្ណោះ។ សូមរៀបរាប់ពីការតាមដាននេះក្នុងគោលការណ៍ភាពឯកជនរបស់អ្នក។"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:222
#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:360
msgid "Google Analytics 4 ID"
msgstr "លេខសម្គាល់ Google Analytics 4"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:227
msgid "Starts with G- (Admin → Data streams in Google Analytics)."
msgstr "ចាប់ផ្ដើមដោយ G- (Admin → Data streams ក្នុង Google Analytics)។"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:233
#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:361
msgid "Google Tag Manager ID"
msgstr "លេខសម្គាល់ Google Tag Manager"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:238
msgid ""
"Starts with GTM-. When set, the GA4 ID above is ignored — add GA4 inside Tag "
"Manager instead."
msgstr ""
"ចាប់ផ្ដើមដោយ GTM-។ នៅពេលកំណត់ លេខសម្គាល់ GA4 ខាងលើនឹងមិនត្រូវប្រើទេ — សូមបន្ថែម GA4 នៅក្នុង "
"Tag Manager ជំនួសវិញ។"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:259
msgid "Login lockout"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:260
msgid ""
"Block an IP address for 15 minutes after 5 failed logins. A one-way hash of "
"the address is kept for that time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:263
msgid "Security headers"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:264
msgid ""
"Send the X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy and "
"Permissions-Policy headers. Other sites can then no longer show your pages "
"in a frame."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:267
msgid "Turn off XML-RPC"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:268
msgid ""
"XML-RPC is a common brute-force target. Keep it on if you use the WordPress "
"mobile app, Jetpack or a remote publishing tool."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:271
msgid "Turn off the file editors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:272
msgid ""
"Remove the theme and plugin file editors from wp-admin, so a stolen admin "
"login cannot change the site's PHP code."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:275
msgid "Hide the user list from visitors"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:276
msgid ""
"Remove the REST API users endpoint for visitors who are not logged in, so "
"author logins cannot be listed. Keep it off if an app or headless front end "
"reads author data."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:280
msgid "Hardening"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:280
msgid ""
"Optional protections for the whole site. Only the login lockout is on by "
"default; turn the others on if nothing you use depends on what they block."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:354
msgid "Latitude must be a number between -90 and 90."
msgstr "រយៈទទឹងត្រូវតែជាលេខចន្លោះ -90 និង 90។"

#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:355
msgid "Longitude must be a number between -180 and 180."
msgstr "រយៈបណ្ដោយត្រូវតែជាលេខចន្លោះ -180 និង 180។"

#. translators: 1: field label, 2: example ID.
#: includes/admin/settings-panels.php:367
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s must look like %2$s."
msgstr "%1$s ត្រូវមានទម្រង់ដូច %2$s។"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:25 includes/admin/translation.php:209
#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:419
msgid "You do not have permission to do this."
msgstr "អ្នកមិនមានសិទ្ធិធ្វើសកម្មភាពនេះទេ។"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:48
msgid "Starting import…"
msgstr "កំពុងចាប់ផ្ដើមនាំចូល…"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:48
msgid "Starting removal…"
msgstr "កំពុងចាប់ផ្ដើមលុប…"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:63
msgid "Job cancelled. Anything already created can still be removed."
msgstr "បានបោះបង់ការងារ។ អ្វីដែលបានបង្កើតរួច នៅតែអាចលុបចេញបាន។"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:85
msgid "Demo content"
msgstr "មាតិកាគំរូ"

#: includes/admin/tools.php:85
msgid ""
"Sample categories, about 140 Khmer and English posts with images, pages, "
"menus and ad placeholders — handy for previewing the theme. Removing deletes "
"only what the import created; your own content and Sbek Theme values are "
"kept."
msgstr ""
"ប្រភេទគំរូ អត្ថបទខ្មែរ និងអង់គ្លេសប្រហែល ១៤០ ព្រមទាំងរូបភាព ទំព័រ ម៉ឺនុយ និងកន្លែងពាណិជ្ជកម្មគំរូ — "
"ងាយស្រួលសម្រាប់មើលស្បែកជាមុន។ ការលុបនឹងលុបតែអ្វីដែលការនាំចូលបានបង្កើតប៉ុណ្ណោះ មាតិកាផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន "
"និងការកំណត់ Sbek Theme របស់អ្នកនៅដដែល។"

#. translators: 1: "import" or "removal", 2: percent.
