msgid ""
"Someone (hopefully you) asked to receive the top stories from %s at this "
"address."
msgstr "មាននរណាម្នាក់ (សង្ឃឹមថាជាអ្នក) បានស្នើសុំទទួលព័ត៌មានសំខាន់ៗពី %s តាមអាសយដ្ឋាននេះ។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:311
msgid "To confirm, open this link:"
msgstr "ដើម្បីបញ្ជាក់ សូមបើកតំណនេះ៖"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:312
msgid ""
"If you did not ask for this, ignore this email and you will not be "
"subscribed."
msgstr "ប្រសិនបើអ្នកមិនបានស្នើសុំទេ សូមមិនអើពើអ៊ីមែលនេះ ហើយអ្នកនឹងមិនត្រូវបានចុះឈ្មោះទេ។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:313
msgid "To unsubscribe at any time:"
msgstr "ដើម្បីឈប់ជាវនៅពេលណាក៏បាន៖"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:383
msgid ""
"Almost done! Check your inbox and click the link to confirm your "
"subscription."
msgstr "ជិតរួចរាល់ហើយ! សូមពិនិត្យប្រអប់សំបុត្ររបស់អ្នក ហើយចុចតំណ ដើម្បីបញ្ជាក់ការជាវ។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:384
msgid "Thanks! Your subscription is confirmed."
msgstr "សូមអរគុណ! ការជាវរបស់អ្នកត្រូវបានបញ្ជាក់។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:385
msgid "This email address is already subscribed."
msgstr "អាសយដ្ឋានអ៊ីមែលនេះបានចុះឈ្មោះរួចហើយ។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:386
msgid "You have been unsubscribed. Sorry to see you go."
msgstr "អ្នកបានឈប់ជាវហើយ។ សោកស្ដាយដែលអ្នកចាកចេញ។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:387
msgid "That link is not valid any more. Please sign up again."
msgstr "តំណនោះលែងមានសុពលភាពហើយ។ សូមចុះឈ្មោះម្ដងទៀត។"

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:388
msgid "The form had expired. Please enter your email address again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/frontend/newsletter.php:389
